---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="de" title="Skills & Fertigkeiten — Ilian Simeonow"  description="Alle Stunt- und Artistik-Fertigkeiten von Ilian Simeonow: Fechten, Highfall, Globe of Speed, Kampfchoreographie und mehr." heroImage="/images/stunt/Fechten-1.jpg">

  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-top-bar"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <div class="section-label">// Fertigkeiten</div>
      <h1 class="page-hero-title">Skills &amp;<br /><span style="color: var(--orange);">Fertigkeiten</span></h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">Stunt · Artistik · Equipment</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="intro-section">
    <div class="section-label">// Profil</div>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Stunt, Artistik<br />&amp; mehr.</h2>
    <p class="body-text" style="max-width: 680px;">
      Nach einer 5½-jährigen Ausbildung an der Staatlichen Ballettschule Berlin spezialisierte sich Ilian auf den Trampolin-Kaskadeur — den Ursprung des modernen Stuntman. Heute beherrscht er ein breites Spektrum an Stunt-, Artistik- und Kampfkünsten.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="skills-full-section">
    <div class="skills-full-grid">

      <div class="skills-full-cat">
        <div class="skills-full-cat-header">
          <div class="section-label">// 01</div>
          <h3 class="skills-full-cat-title">Artistik / X-treme Artistik</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="skills-full-list">
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Trampolin</strong><span>Diplom-Artist · Trampolin-Kaskadeur · Grundlage der Stuntausbildung</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Schleuderbrett</strong><span>Akrobatisches Schleuderbrett für Partner-Nummern und Stunts</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Boden-Akrobatik</strong><span>Handstand, Salti, Überschläge — komplette Bodenturner-Ausbildung</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Jonglage</strong><span>Bälle, Keulen, Ringe — Show- und Bühnenjuggling</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Close-Up / Stand-Up</strong><span>Nahzauber, Publikumsnummern, Bühnen-Comedy</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Zauberei &amp; Illusion</strong><span>Bühnenmagie, Illusionsnummern, Moderation</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Turmspringen</strong><span>High-Diving — Stunts vom Sprungturm</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Äquilibristik</strong><span>Gleichgewichtskunst — Balance auf instabilen Untergründen</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Globe of Speed</strong><span>Motorrad-Globe-of-Speed — Einzelnummer und Gruppe</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Todesrad (Wheel of Death)</strong><span>Große rotierende Artistik-Apparatur — Soloshow und Duett</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Feuerspucken / -schlucken</strong><span>Feuershow für Bühne, Open Air und Film</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="skills-full-cat">
        <div class="skills-full-cat-header">
          <div class="section-label">// 02</div>
          <h3 class="skills-full-cat-title">Stunt</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="skills-full-list">
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Show-Choreographie</strong><span>Konzeption und Koordination von Kampfszenen für Film und Bühne</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Fechten &amp; Schwertkampf</strong><span>Degen, Säbel, Langschwert — für Film, Theater und Show</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Body Stunt</strong><span>Treppenstürze, Schleifer, Autoüberroller, Fahrradsturz</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Highfall</strong><span>Stürze aus großer Höhe — Gebäude, Treppen, Fahrzeuge</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Reiten (Stuntreiter)</strong><span>Galoppreiten, Stuntsequenzen zu Pferd, Western- und Historienreiten</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Kampfsport</strong><span>Tae Kwon Do · Capoeira · Filipino · Judo · Thai/Kickboxen · Boxen · Modern Arnis</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Schusswaffen-Ausbildung</strong><span>Inkl. Vorderlader-Pistolen, Gewehre und Kanonen (Schwarzpulver)</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Abseilen</strong><span>Industrieklettern, Rappelling, vertikale Stunts</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Kampfszenen jeglicher Art</strong><span>Film- und Theaterkampf, Stage Combat, Stunts mit Darstellern</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="skills-full-cat">
        <div class="skills-full-cat-header">
          <div class="section-label">// 03</div>
          <h3 class="skills-full-cat-title">Eigenes Equipment</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="skills-full-list">
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Matten</strong><span>Verschiedene Größen und Stärken für Stunts und Training</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Abseil-Equipment</strong><span>Komplette Ausrüstung für vertikale Stunts</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Degen &amp; Schwerter</strong><span>Diverses Fechterequipment für Film, Theater und Show</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Polizei-Uniform NRW</strong><span>Originalgetreue Ausstattung für Film und TV</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Mittelalter-Kostüm</strong><span>Komplettes Ritter- und Mittelalter-Kostüm</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Western-Kostüm</strong><span>Authentisches Western-Outfit für Karl-May und Western-Produktionen</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-section">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">// Buchung</div>
      <div class="contact-heading">Interesse?<br />Kontaktieren Sie<br />uns.</div>
      <div class="contact-actions">
        <a href="/kontakt/" class="btn-primary">Anfrage senden</a>
        <a href="/pdfs/setcard.pdf" download class="btn-ghost">↓ Sedcard PDF</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-info">
      <div class="contact-detail"><strong>Telefon</strong>+49 (0)176 / 303 101 42</div>
      <div class="contact-detail"><strong>E-Mail</strong>actionartist@web.de</div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
.page-hero {
  min-height: 45vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  padding: 80px var(--page-pad) 56px;
  position: relative;
  background: linear-gradient(175deg, #0e0e0e 0%, #1c0c04 55%, #0e0e0e 100%);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.page-hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
.page-hero-title {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px);
  font-weight: bold;
  line-height: 0.9;
  letter-spacing: -2px;
  color: var(--white);
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.page-hero-sub {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 13px;
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--gray);
}
.intro-section {
  padding: 64px var(--page-pad) 48px;
  background: var(--black);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
}
.skills-full-section {
  padding: 0 var(--page-pad) var(--section-pad);
  background: var(--black);
}
.skills-full-grid {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--border);
}
.skills-full-cat {
  background: var(--black);
  padding: 48px 0;
}
.skills-full-cat + .skills-full-cat {
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding-top: 48px;
}
.skills-full-cat-header { margin-bottom: 32px; }
.skills-full-cat-title {
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px);
  color: var(--white);
  font-weight: bold;
  margin-top: 8px;
}
.skills-full-list {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1px;
  background: var(--border);
}
.skills-full-list li {
  background: var(--card);
  padding: 20px 24px;
  display: flex;
  gap: 14px;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.skill-dot-lg {
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--orange);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 7px;
}
.skills-full-list li strong {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--white);
  font-weight: 600;
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.skills-full-list li span {
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--gray);
  line-height: 1.5;
  display: block;
}
</style>
